@startuml diagram_mission_validation
title Mission Validation — Four Strategies

actor Player
actor GameMaker
actor ThirdParty as "Third party\n(no app identity)"
participant Cockpit as "Player Cockpit"
participant ValidationDisplay as "ValidationDisplay"
participant upsert as "upsertProgressEvent"
participant PB as "PocketBase"
participant PeerPage as "PeerScanPage"

note over Player, PB
  **Form missions (type = form)** always write status: autoApproved on submit.
  validationMethod is ignored. GM always sees formResponse in hire analytics.
end note

== 1. gmApprove — player requests, GM approves in web UI ==

Player -> Cockpit : Mark mission complete
Cockpit -> upsert : status: pendingApproval
upsert -> PB : progress_events upsert
Cockpit -> ValidationDisplay : "Waiting for approval"
GameMaker -> PB : PendingApprovalsPanel
GameMaker -> upsert : status: completed, validatedBy
upsert -> PB : PATCH
PB --> ValidationDisplay : SSE / poll → dismiss
note right : Player earns mission.xpValue XP\n(computeProgress at read time)

== 2. qr — player shows QR, GM scans to confirm ==

Player -> Cockpit : Mark complete
note over Cockpit : **No ProgressEvent write yet (C-07)**
Cockpit -> ValidationDisplay : QRDisplay encodes\n/validate/{sessionId}?t={signed}
GameMaker -> ValidationDisplay : Scan URL (camera or in-app scanner)
GameMaker -> upsert : status: completed (ValidationPage)
upsert -> PB : write
PB --> Cockpit : SSE → XP updates

== 3. selfApprove — player self-validates ==

Player -> Cockpit : Mark complete
Cockpit -> upsert : status: autoApproved
upsert -> PB : write
note over ValidationDisplay : ValidationDisplay does not mount

== 4. peerScan — player shows QR, N unique third parties scan ==

Player -> Cockpit : Open mission → show PeerQRDisplay
note over Cockpit
  QR encodes /peer/{sessionId}?t={signed}
  Mission.peerScanTarget = required unique scans (e.g. 5)
end note

ThirdParty -> PeerPage : Scan QR → name / custom form
PeerPage -> PB : INSERT peer_scans\n(scannerDeviceId unique per mission+player)
PB --> GameMaker : SSE live feed in hire analytics

alt count(peer_scans) >= peerScanTarget
  PeerPage -> upsert : status: completed
  upsert -> PB : progress_events upsert
  PB --> Cockpit : mission complete + XP
end

@enduml
